WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,010
Sir

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:03,260
Why don't you open your mouth and give me advice?

3
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:04,340
Let them fight

4
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,140
This happens every year when they meet

5
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,420
It’s also good to take a dozen shots.

6
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:09,860
Let the chicken's year of grudges and anger go away

7
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,420
Only in this way can we talk about things well

8
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:12,620
Otherwise, we can talk directly

9
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:15,020
Believe it or not, we can't even discuss this matter for a month.

10
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,340
If a fight really breaks out

11
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,740
Then it's not such a small fight

12
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:21,210
Fortunately, everyone has lost their sense of propriety.

13
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:32,810
Don't be so harsh

14
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:34,810
Bite me on my ass

15
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:46,650
Is the fight over?

16
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:49,290
When you're done, hurry up and pack your things.

17
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:50,290
Otherwise

18
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:52,960
Don't ask for anyone this time

19
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:55,360
I directly suggest that General Shen go back to being alone

20
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:57,060
List a few camps
